# Coding standards v1 (antoniwan/ai shared/standards). Copy as .gitattributes at a repo's root.
# Text is stored with LF on every device, whatever the local core.autocrlf says.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows scripts keep CRLF so older PowerShell and cmd read them.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# Binary: git never changes their bytes or shows a diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
